{%- comment -%}
  Size guide link shown inside a dimension accordion (Width, Length) on the
  shower curtain PDP. Shower curtains have no calculator app, so this is the
  counterpart of 'calculate-dimensions-link': the content comes from the
  variant picker's "Content" richtext setting instead of opening the modal.

  Accepts:
  - block: the variant picker block holding the "Content" setting
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
  <div class="rte product-form__text calculator-curtain-text">
    {{ block.settings.text | replace: '<a ', '<a target="_blank" rel="noopener" ' }}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
